Yeah.
好的。

1226
00:49:30.560 --> 00:49:34.240
You can send us questions at officeladies at earwolf.com.
你们可以发送问题到 officeladies@earwolf.com。

1227
00:49:34.520 --> 00:49:40.220
If you have any questions about an episode, put that episode title in the subject line and we will read them all.
如果你对某一集有任何问题，请在主题栏写上该集的标题，我们会全部阅读。

1228
