And then they also said if you want to leave us a voice memo, we could actually play you asking your question in the podcaSt.
他们还说，如果你想给我们留语音备忘录，我们甚至可以在播客里播放你提问的声音。

1230
00:49:48.040 --> 00:49:48.700
Which would be kind of cool.
那会很酷。

1231
00:49:48.720 --> 00:49:49.580
Which would be kind of cool.
那会很酷。

1232
00:49:49.780 --> 00:49:50.100
Yes.
是的。

